  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "BODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/05033828bccdc58309b2410d3862c53cfbbb99ad1c921a44c94d086c69ad1c45.png] \n\nAccording to the question, the letters are interchanged with mathematical operators as follows:\n\n \n \n\n Letter\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Operator\n ÷\n ×\n +\n −\n \n \n\n \n\n**1) 84 C 12 D 76 A 36 B 4**\n\nEquation: 84 + 12 − 76 ÷ 36 × 4\n\n⇒ 84 + 12 − __**76 ÷ 36**__ × 4\n\n⇒ 84 + 12 − __**2.11 × 4**__\n\n⇒ __**84 + 12**__ − 8.44\n\n⇒ __**96 − 8.44**__\n\n⇒ 87.56 ≠ 75 (Incorrect)\n\n**2) 84 B 12 C 76 D 36 A 4**\n\nEquation: 84 × 12 + 76 − 36 ÷ 4\n\n⇒ __**84 × 12**__ + 76 − 36 ÷ 4\n\n⇒ 1008 + 76 − __**36 ÷ 4**__\n\n⇒ __**1008 + 76**__ − 9\n\n⇒ __**1084 − 9**__\n\n⇒ 1075 ≠ 75 (Incorrect)\n\n**3) 84 A 12 D 76 C 36 B 4**\n\nEquation: 84 ÷ 12 − 76 + 36 × 4\n\n⇒ __**84 ÷ 12**__ − 76 + 36 × 4\n\n⇒ 7 − 76 + __**36 × 4**__\n\n⇒ __**7 − 76**__ + 144\n\n⇒ __**−69 + 144**__\n\n⇒ 75 = 75 (Correct)\n\n**4) 84 D 12 A 76 B 36 C 4**\n\nEquation: 84 − 12 ÷ 76 × 36 + 4\n\n⇒ 84 − __**12 ÷ 76**__ × 36 + 4\n\n⇒ 84 − __**0.16 × 36**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**84 − 5.76**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**78.24 + 4**__\n\n⇒ 82.24 ≠ 75 (Incorrect)\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".\n\n1",
